he Sierra Nevada mountain range. It is a city with a population of about 79,871 people, and it is located in the heart of the California Central Valley, in the foothills of the Sierra Nevada mountain range. It is a city with a population of about 79,871 people, and it is located in the heart of the California Central Valley, in the foothills of the Sierra Nevada mountain range. It is a city with a population of about 79,871 people, and it is located in the heart of the California Central Valley, in the foothills of the Sierra Nevada mountain range. It is a city with a population of about 79,871 people, and it is located in the heart of the California Central Valley, in the foothills of the Sierra Nevada mountain range. It is a city with a population of about 79,871 people, and it is located in the heart of the California Central Valley, in the foothills of the Sierra Nevada mountain range. It is a city with a population of about 79,871 people, and it is located in the heart of the California Central Valley, in the foothills of the Sierra Nevada mountain range. It is a city with a population of about 79,871 people, and it is located in the heart of the California Central Valley, in the foothills of the Sierra Nevada mountain range. It is a city with a population of about 79,871 people, and it is located in the heart of the California Central Valley, in the foothills of the Sierra Nevada mountain range. It is a city with a population of about 79,871 people, and it is located in the heart of the California Central Valley, in the foothills of the Sierra Nevada mountain range. It is a city with a population of about 79,871 people, and it is located in the heart of the California Central Valley, in the foothills of the Sierra Nevada mountain", "num_tokens": 1536, "green_tokens": 1154, "green_fraction": 0.7513020833333334, "z_score": 19.69798001488139, "p_value": 1.1219791068766824e-86, "dedup_num_tokens": 104, "dedup_green_tokens": 62, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5961538461