{"id": "dolly-00303", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nI am on a week long vacation to India and specifically want to explore Himalayan state of Himachal Pradesh. How should I plan my trip ?\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Firstly, I recommend researching and reading up on the history, geography, and culture of the Himalayan state of Himachal Pradesh. This will help you gain a better understanding of the region and make it easier to plan your trip. It is also advisable to research and plan your itinerary in advance so that you can make the most of your time in the region. Finally, I recommend taking advantage of the unique opportunities and attractions in the Himalayan state of Himachal Pradesh, such as trekking, visiting nature reserves, and enjoying traditional festivals and customs.", "num_tokens": 113, "green_tokens": 75, "green_fraction": 0.6637168141592921, "z_score": 3.4806672130193097, "p_value": 0.00025008325625030186, "dedup_num_tokens": 97, "dedup_green_tokens": 63, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.6494845360824743, "dedup_z_score": 2.9445038788874953, "dedup_p_value": 0.0016173644587460037, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 127, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-01059", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWho started Belu?\n\n### Context:\nBelu was founded in 2004 by film maker Reed Paget as a bottled water business with an aim to be an environmentally friendly alternative to other beverages on the market. Before launching Belu, Paget was a keen environmentalist in business communities, encouraging others in the drinks industry to consider the environmental impact of sourcing, manufacturing and packaging. Early stage investors in Belu included Body Shop co-founder Gordon Roddick, environmentalist Ben Goldsmith and hedge fund manager, Chris Cooper-Hohn\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Reed Paget is the founder and CEO of Belu, a bottled water company. He started Belu as a bottled water business in 2004 and aimed to be an environmentally friendly alternative to other beverages on the market. Before launching Belu, Paget was a keen environmentalist in business communities, encouraging others in the drinks industry to consider the environmental impact of sourcing, manufacturing and packaging. Early stage investors in Belu included Gordon Roddick, environmentalist Ben Goldsmith, and hedge fund manager, Chris Cooper-Hohn.", "num_tokens": 110, "green_tokens": 47, "green_fraction": 0.42727272727272725, "z_score": -1.5255401427929478, "p_value": 0.9364377855287733, "dedup_num_tokens": 102, "dedup_green_tokens": 45, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.4411764705882353, "dedup_z_score": -1.1881770515720091, "dedup_p_value": 0.8826181685861654, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 128, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-09590", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWho composed The Planets suit (both names)\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "The Planets suit was composed by the legendary composer, composer, and lyricist, John Philip Sousa. He composed over 700 songs, and is widely regarded as one of the most influential composers in the history of music.\n Crimea", "num_tokens": 49, "green_tokens": 30, "green_fraction": 0.6122448979591837, "z_score": 1.5714285714285714, "p_value": 0.058041566869327516, "dedup_num_tokens": 47, "dedup_green_tokens": 28, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5957446808510638, "dedup_z_score": 1.3127849234810511, "dedup_p_value": 0.09462771584600876, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 129, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-00997", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nClassify each of the following as either a country or a city: Sweden, France, Paris, Bali, Rotterdam, Seville, India, San Fransisco, Amritsar, Portugal\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Certainly! Here's how each of the given countries and cities are classified:\n\nCountry: Sweden\nCity: Sweden (itself)\n\nCountry: France\nCity: Paris (itself)\n\nCountry: Bali\nCity: Bali (itself)\n\nCountry: Rotterdam\nCity: Rotterdam (itself)\n\nCountry: Seville\nCity: Seville (itself)\n\nCountry: India\nCity: India (itself)\n\nCountry: San Fransisco\nCity: San Fransisco (itself)\n\nCountry: Amritsar\nCity: Amritsar (itself)\n\nCountry: Portugal\nCity: Portugal (itself)\n\nEach of these is a country, and they are all listed in the order they are provided.\n endwhile", "num_tokens": 146, "green_tokens": 107, "green_fraction": 0.7328767123287672, "z_score": 5.627720042496102, "p_value": 9.130357117765847e-09, "dedup_num_tokens": 76, "dedup_green_tokens": 51, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.6710526315789473, "dedup_z_score": 2.9824045403173027, "dedup_p_value": 0.0014299691042320504, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 130, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-09633", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWho was Bosch's dad?\n\n### Context:\nBosch's mother was a prostitute in Hollywood who was murdered on October 28, 1961, when Bosch was 11 years old. His father, who he met later in life, was Mickey Haller Sr., a prominent defense attorney known for representing mobster Mickey Cohen, among other clients.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "The answer to the question \"Who was Bosch's dad?\" is Mickey Haller Sr., a prominent defense attorney who represented mobster Mickey Cohen among other clients.", "num_tokens": 32, "green_tokens": 13, "green_fraction": 0.40625, "z_score": -1.0606601717798212, "p_value": 0.8555778168267576, "dedup_num_tokens": 32, "dedup_green_tokens": 13, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.40625, "dedup_z_score": -1.0606601717798212, "dedup_p_value": 0.8555778168267576, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 131, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
