{"id": "dolly-02678", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhich of these books were written by James Michener and which were written by Ian McEwan: Tales of the South Pacific, Saturday, Atonement, The Children Act, Hawaii, Texas, On Chesil Beach, and Alaska.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "The books written by James Michener include Tales of the South Pacific, Saturday, Atonement, and Hawaii. He was the author of the novel The Children Act, while Ian McEwan wrote The Children Act and Alaska.", "num_tokens": 46, "green_tokens": 29, "green_fraction": 0.6304347826086957, "z_score": 1.7693034738587656, "p_value": 0.03842162201682817, "dedup_num_tokens": 43, "dedup_green_tokens": 27, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.627906976744186, "dedup_z_score": 1.6774842736586515, "dedup_p_value": 0.04672391107930719, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 137, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-10208", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nPropose a text about young boy that wanted to fly his kite over the skyscrapers. Make this a very positive story with a twist\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Certainly! Here's a text that fits the criteria:\n\n---\n\nTitle: \"From Skyscraper to Skydiver: Young Boy's Flight to the Sky\"\n\nOnce upon a time in the bustling metropolis of New York City, there was a curious little boy named Jake. He was always eager to explore and learn new things, and he had a special talent for flying kites. One sunny day, while playing in the park, Jake decided to try his hand at flying kites high above the skyscrapers that lined the city's skyline.\n\nAs Jake started his flight, he couldn't believe what was happening. The wind was fierce, and the air was so thick that it seemed like he was floating in midair. But as he continued his flight, he began to feel the strength of the wind and the thrill of the air. He could see the skyline from above and felt a sense of freedom and excitement.\n\nAs Jake's kite flew higher and higher, he began to feel a sense of accomplishment and pride. He had never before felt so alive and free, and he knew that this was his life's work. As he soared through the sky, he couldn't help but feel grateful for the gift of flight and the freedom it brought him.\n\n---\n\n---", "num_tokens": 254, "green_tokens": 141, "green_fraction": 0.5551181102362205, "z_score": 1.756876254386844, "p_value": 0.03946945193974952, "dedup_num_tokens": 228, "dedup_green_tokens": 127, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5570175438596491, "dedup_z_score": 1.721892064184557, "dedup_p_value": 0.0425445364081019, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 138, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-08008", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhen being in cold weather, categorize each of the following as \"Useful\" or \"Not Useful\": Coat, Air Condition, Ice, Beanie, Pants, Bikini\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "The instructions are clear. Here's my response:\n\nccoat, air conditioner, ice, beanie, pants, bikini", "num_tokens": 24, "green_tokens": 11, "green_fraction": 0.4583333333333333, "z_score": -0.4082482904638631, "p_value": 0.6584543008451956, "dedup_num_tokens": 24, "dedup_green_tokens": 11, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.4583333333333333, "dedup_z_score": -0.4082482904638631, "dedup_p_value": 0.6584543008451956, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 139, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-08789", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhich is a species of fish? Boar or Boarfish\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Boarfish (also known as boar, walleye, and walleye) is a species of fish that belongs to the order Salmoniformes, and is native to the boreal forest regions of North America, Europe, and Asia. It is a medium-sized freshwater fish that measures around 35 centimeters in length, and is known for its distinctive black coloration and large size. Boarfish are carnivorous, and feed on small fish, crayfish, and other aquatic insects, and are a key food source for fisherman.", "num_tokens": 113, "green_tokens": 73, "green_fraction": 0.6460176991150443, "z_score": 3.104378865665871, "p_value": 0.0009533949500686782, "dedup_num_tokens": 100, "dedup_green_tokens": 63, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.63, "dedup_z_score": 2.6, "dedup_p_value": 0.004661188023718751, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 140, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
