{"id": "dolly-05297", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nHow did Uzunkum become a lovely sandy-beach park in Turkey?\n\n### Context:\nUzunkum Nature Park (Turkish: Uzunkum Tabiat Parkı) is a nature park declared coastal area in Kocaeli Province, northwestern Turkey. Uzunkum, literally long sandy beach, is located at Black Sea east of Cebeci village in Kandıra district of Kocaeli Province. The area was declared a nature park by the Ministry of Environment and Forest in 2014. The nature park consists of the parts, the sandy beach in the north and forested hillside. It covers an area of 235 ha (580 acres).\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Uzunkum is a coastal nature park located in the Kocaeli Province, Turkey. It was declared a nature park in 2014 and is known for its long sandy beach and coastal vegetation.", "num_tokens": 44, "green_tokens": 23, "green_fraction": 0.5227272727272727, "z_score": 0.30151134457776363, "p_value": 0.3815123002764975, "dedup_num_tokens": 43, "dedup_green_tokens": 22, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5116279069767442, "dedup_z_score": 0.15249857033260467, "dedup_p_value": 0.43939685897964886, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 145, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-00275", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhy isn't multi-threading making my Python code faster? How can I fix it.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Multi-threading can help speed up your Python code by dividing the workload across multiple processes, allowing them to run concurrently. However, this can also introduce additional overhead and performance issues. Some potential causes of slower performance could be due to the use of locks, mutexes, or other synchronization mechanisms that are not optimized for multi-threading scenarios. Additionally, if your code is heavily dependent on external resources such as network or file access, these may also impact performance. It's essential to thoroughly test and analyze your code to identify the root cause of the slow performance and implement appropriate solutions to address it.", "num_tokens": 119, "green_tokens": 61, "green_fraction": 0.5126050420168067, "z_score": 0.2750095491084634, "p_value": 0.39165445097425433, "dedup_num_tokens": 117, "dedup_green_tokens": 59, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5042735042735043, "dedup_z_score": 0.09245003270420485, "dedup_p_value": 0.4631702446255759, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 146, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-14036", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nGiven the following passage about Theodore Roosevelt, please list the main accomplishments during his presidency.\n\n### Context:\nRoosevelt assumed the presidency at age 42, and remains the youngest person to become president of the United States. As a leader of the progressive movement he championed his \"Square Deal\" domestic policies. It called for fairness for all citizens, breaking of bad trusts, regulation of railroads, and pure food and drugs. Roosevelt prioritized conservation and established national parks, forests, and monuments to preserve the nation's natural resources. In foreign policy, he focused on Central America, where he began construction of the Panama Canal. Roosevelt expanded the Navy and sent the Great White Fleet on a world tour to project American naval power. His successful efforts to broker the end of the Russo-Japanese War won him the 1906 Nobel Peace Prize, making him the first American to ever win a Nobel Prize. Roosevelt was elected to a full term in 1904 and promoted policies more to the left, despite growing opposition from Republican leaders. During his presidency, he groomed his close ally William Howard Taft to succeed him in the 1908 presidential election.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Theodore Roosevelt, the 26th President of the United States, was a prominent figure in the Progressive Era and was widely recognized for his leadership in the movement for social and political reform. He was born into a family of political leaders and was the first child born to Theodore and Edna. Roosevelt was elected to the presidency at age 42 and served until his death in office in 1919.\n\nThroughout his presidency, Roosevelt championed progressive policies that aimed to address social and economic issues. He was the first president to promote the \"Square Deal\" policy, which called for fairness for all citizens, breaking of bad trusts, and regulation of railroads. He was also the first to establish national parks, forests, and monuments to preserve the nation's natural resources. In foreign policy, Roosevelt focused on Central America, where he began construction of the Panama Canal.\n\nHowever, Roosevelt's presidency was marked by growing opposition from Republican leaders, and he was eventually elected to a full term in the 1904 presidential election. He was elected to the presidency due to his strong political ties and popularity, and he was able to win the election due to the strong support of the Democratic Party. Roosevelt was a vocal opponent of the war in the Russo-Japanese conflict, and he was forced to resign in the 1911 presidential election after losing the support of the Democratic Party.\n\nThroughout his presidency, Roosevelt was known for his leadership and dedication to social and political reform. He was widely recognized for his achievements and was honored with a number of awards, including the Presidential Medal of Freedom. He was the first president to receive the Nobel Peace Prize in 1906, and he was the first to receive the Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine in 1916.\n\nOverall, Theodore Roosevelt was a key figure in the Progressive Era and was widely recognized for his leadership and dedication to social and political reform. He was elected to the presidency at age 42 and served until his death in office in 1919.", "num_tokens": 414, "green_tokens": 232, "green_fraction": 0.5603864734299517, "z_score": 2.4573659359149524, "p_value": 0.006998001948535266, "dedup_num_tokens": 274, "dedup_green_tokens": 144, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5255474452554745, "dedup_z_score": 0.8457709306622477, "dedup_p_value": 0.19884027250247466, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 147, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-08391", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nGiven a reference tax about a footballer, tell me when they were born, what is their nationalities and which years they won the FIFA World cup.\n\n### Context:\nLionel Andrés Messi[note 1] (Spanish pronunciation: [ljoˈnel anˈdɾes ˈmesi] (listen); born 24 June 1987), also known as Leo Messi, is an Argentine professional footballer who plays as a forward for Ligue 1 club Paris Saint-Germain and captains the Argentina national team. Widely regarded as one of the greatest players of all time, Messi has won a record seven Ballon d'Or awards[note 2] and a record six European Golden Shoes, and in 2020 he was named to the Ballon d'Or Dream Team. Until leaving the club in 2021, he had spent his entire professional career with Barcelona, where he won a club-record 34 trophies, including 10 La Liga titles, seven Copa del Rey titles and four UEFA Champions Leagues. With his country, he won the 2021 Copa América and the 2022 FIFA World Cup. A prolific goalscorer and creative playmaker, Messi holds the records for most goals in La Liga (474), most hat-tricks in La Liga (36) and the UEFA Champions League (eight), and most assists in La Liga (192) and the Copa América (17). He also has the most international goals by a South American male (102). Messi has scored over 800 senior career goals for club and country, and has the most goals by a player for a single club (672).\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Lionel Andrés Messi[note 1] (Spanish pronunciation: [ljoˈnel anˈdɾes ˈmesi] (listen); born 24 June 1987), also known as Leo Mess