{"id": "dolly-13749", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nGiven this paragraph about Saffron, where does this name originally come from?\n\n### Context:\nA degree of uncertainty surrounds the origin of the English word \"saffron\". It might stem from the 12th-century Old French term safran, which comes from the Latin word safranum, from the Arabic (زَعْفَرَان), za'farān, which comes from the Persian word zarparan meaning \"gold strung\" (implying either the golden stamens of the flower or the golden color it creates when used as flavor).\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "The term \"saffron\" is an English word that has been influenced by the Persian word \"zarparan,\" which is a term used in the Middle Eastern region. This term can also be traced back to the Arabic word \"safran,\" which is a term used in the Middle Eastern region.", "num_tokens": 62, "green_tokens": 44, "green_fraction": 0.7096774193548387, "z_score": 3.302003302004953, "p_value": 0.0004799847003032714, "dedup_num_tokens": 49, "dedup_green_tokens": 33, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.673469387755102, "dedup_z_score": 2.4285714285714284, "dedup_p_value": 0.007579219438719734, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 177, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-07983", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhat are the top 5 places to eat while visiting Milwaukee, Wisconsin?\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Certainly! Here's my top five picks for dining out in Milwaukee, Wisconsin:\n\n1. **Fish and Chips**: A classic spot for a taste of the local cuisine, with a great selection of fish and chips to choose from.\n2. **Soul Food Kitchen**: A family-owned restaurant that serves up delicious soul food-style dishes, with a great atmosphere and friendly service.\n3. **Pike's Bay**: A great choice for a seafood experience, with a great selection of fresh seafood to choose from and a great atmosphere.\n4. **Gladys: A Diner**: A small, family-owned restaurant that offers a great selection of American favorites, with a great atmosphere and friendly service.\n5. **Papa's Kitchen**: A great choice for a more casual dining experience, with a great selection of dishes, a great atmosphere, and a friendly service.\n\nI hope you enjoy your time in Milwaukee! Let me know if there's anything else you need help with.", "num_tokens": 196, "green_tokens": 128, "green_fraction": 0.6530612244897959, "z_score": 4.285714285714286, "p_value": 9.107648574484022e-06, "dedup_num_tokens": 143, "dedup_green_tokens": 88, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.6153846153846154, "dedup_z_score": 2.7595986330233995, "dedup_p_value": 0.002893620718183102, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 178, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-09930", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhat do I need to be aware of when talking to an alien?\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "When talking to an alien, it's important to be aware of the cultural differences and communication styles. It's common for aliens to have different communication styles, so it's important to be respectful and open to understanding their ways of communicating. It's also important to be aware of the alien's cultural beliefs and traditions, and to be willing to listen and learn from them. Finally, it's important to be aware of the alien's emotions and to be willing to respond in a way that is respectful and empathetic.", "num_tokens": 103, "green_tokens": 63, "green_fraction": 0.6116504854368932, "z_score": 2.2662573397778742, "p_value": 0.01171781586721677, "dedup_num_tokens": 75, "dedup_green_tokens": 42, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.56, "dedup_z_score": 1.0392304845413263, "dedup_p_value": 0.1493487779974851, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 179, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-05394", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhat is the difference between NAFTA and NATO?\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "NAFTA stands for North American Free Trade Agreement. It is a trade agreement among North American countries, including the United States, Canada, and Mexico. It aims to increase trade and economic cooperation between the three countries.\n\nNAATO stands for North Atlantic Treaty Organization. It is a military alliance among North American countries, including the United States, Canada, and Mexico. It is a defense organization that aims to protect the North American region from potential threats.", "num_tokens": 89, "green_tokens": 47, "green_fraction": 0.5280898876404494, "z_score": 0.52999894000318, "p_value": 0.2980563328616619, "dedup_num_tokens": 63, "dedup_green_tokens": 30, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.47619047619047616, "dedup_z_score": -0.3779644730092272, "dedup_p_value": 0.6472715069443633, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 180, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-02286", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhat is postmodernism?\n\n### Context:\nPostmodernism is an intellectual stance or mode of discourse characterized by skepticism toward the \"grand narratives\" of modernism; rejection of epistemic certainty or the stability of meaning; and sensitivity to the role of ideology in maintaining political power. Claims to objectivity are dismissed as naïve realism, with attention drawn to the conditional nature of knowledge claims within particular historical, political, and cultural discourses. The postmodern outlook is characterized by self-referentiality, epistemological relativism, moral relativism, pluralism, irony, irreverence, and eclecticism; it rejects the \"universal validity\" of binary oppositions, stable identity, hierarchy, and categorization\n\nInitially emerging from a mode of literary criticism, postmodernism developed in the mid-twentieth century as a rejection of modernism, and has been observed across many disciplines. Postmodernism is associated with the disciplines deconstruction and post-structuralism. Various authors have criticized postmodernism as promoting obscurantism, as abandoning Enlightenment rationalism and scientific rigor, and as adding nothing to analytical or empirical knowledge\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Postmodernism is a philosophical, literary, and social movement that critiques modernism as an artificial construct that seeks to maintain an objective and neutral stance. It is characterized by skepticism toward the grand narratives of modernism, rejection of epistemic certainty or the stability of meaning, and sensitivity to the role of ideology in maintaining political power.\n\nPostmodernism is often associated with literary criticism and has influenced many disciplines. It is also associated with deconstruction and post-structuralism, and has been criticized as promoting obscurantism and abandoning Enlightenment rationalism and scientific rigor.\n\nUltimately, postmodernism is characterized by self-referentiality, epistemological relativism, moral relativism, pluralism, irony, irreverence, and eclecticism. It rejects the \"universal validity\" of binary oppositions, stable identity, hierarchy, and categorization.\n\n댓글을 남겨주세요.", "num_tokens": 180, "green_tokens": 101, "green_fraction": 0.5611111111111111, "z_score": 1.6397831834998458, "p_value": 0.05052512796270499, "dedup_num_tokens": 157, "dedup_green_tokens": 80, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5095541401273885, "dedup_z_score": 0.23942606534028665, "dedup_p_value": 0.40538761022254977, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 181, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-09109", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nAs a 16-year old high school student, write a short summary of your visit to the Vermeer exhibition in the Rijksmuseum.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "The Vermeer exhibition at the Rijksmuseum was a fascinating and enriching experience for me. I was able to explore the works of this renowned Dutch painter and learn about his life, techniques, and themes. It was impressive to see how he used color and texture to create such beautiful images, and how he approached his work in different styles and mediums. It was also interesting to learn about the artist's background, and how his work reflects his personal experiences and emotions throughout his career. Overall, my visit to the Vermeer exhibition was an eye-opening and inspiring experience that I will cherish for years to come.", "num_tokens": 124, "green_tokens": 63, "green_fraction": 0.5080645161290323, "z_score": 0.1796053020267749, "p_value": 0.4287312209796206, "dedup_num_tokens": 114, "dedup_green_tokens": 56, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.49122807017543857, "dedup_z_score": -0.1873171623163388, "dedup_p_value": 0.5742940162199197, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 182, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
