{"id": "dolly-08406", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nGive me a bulleted list of ten things cities I should visit in Spain\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Here's a list of ten things you should visit in Spain:\n\n1. Visit the historic center of Barcelona, the city that was the birthplace of the Spanish Revolution.\n2. Explore the iconic landmarks, such as the Sagrada Familia and the Church of the Sagrada Familia, in Barcelona.\n3. Take a tour of the Gothic Quarter and enjoy a visit to the Old Town Quarter, a beautiful old quarter of the city.\n4. Visit the Puerta del Sol, a stunning fortress that offers a glimpse of the history and culture of the region.\n5. Explore the historic center of Astorga, a beautiful old quarter of the city.\n6. Take a tour of the Gothic Quarter and enjoy a visit to the Old Town Quarter, a beautiful old quarter of the city.\n7. Visit the Museo del Prado, a museum that showcases the art of the Spanish Golden Age.\n8. Explore the historic center of Valencia, a beautiful old quarter of the city.\n9. Take a tour of the Gothic Quarter and enjoy a visit to the Old Town Quarter, a beautiful old quarter of the city.\n10. Visit the historic center of Madrid, the capital city of Spain, and explore its beautiful architecture, museums, and historical landmarks.", "num_tokens": 255, "green_tokens": 155, "green_fraction": 0.6078431372549019, "z_score": 3.4442336009683223, "p_value": 0.000286340338646841, "dedup_num_tokens": 153, "dedup_green_tokens": 86, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5620915032679739, "dedup_z_score": 1.5360589585634423, "dedup_p_value": 0.0