{"id": "dolly-02516", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nExtract comma separated list of the names of the tenants of the Willis Tower from the text.\n\n### Context:\nThe Willis Tower (originally the Sears Tower) is a 110-story, 1,451-foot (442.3 m) skyscraper in the Loop community area of Chicago in Illinois, United States. Designed by architect Bruce Graham and engineer Fazlur Rahman Khan of Skidmore, Owings & Merrill (SOM), it opened in 1973 as the world's tallest building, a title that it held for nearly 25 years. It is the third-tallest building in the Western Hemisphere, as well as the 23rd-tallest in the world. Each year, more than 1.7 million people visit the Skydeck observation deck, the highest in the United States, making it one of Chicago's most popular tourist destinations. As of April 2018, the building's largest tenant is United Airlines, which occupies around 20 floors. Other major tenants include the building's namesake Willis Towers Watson and law firms Schiff Hardin and Seyfarth Shaw. Morgan Stanley became the building's fourth-largest tenant in 2017.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "The tenants of the Willis Tower are Willis Towers Watson, law firms Schiff Hardin and Seyfarth Shaw, and Morgan Stanley.", "num_tokens": 26, "green_tokens": 16, "green_fraction": 0.6153846153846154, "z_score": 1.1766968108291043, "p_value": 0.11965827061074763, "dedup_num_tokens": 26, "dedup_green_tokens": 16, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.6153846153846154, "dedup_z_score": 1.1766968108291043, "dedup_p_value": 0.11965827061074763, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 223, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-02844", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhich of the following are deciduous trees?\n\nAbies concolor\nAcer rubrum\nAcer saccharinum\nCornus florida\nGleditsia triacanthos\nPicea glauca\npicea pungens\nPicea abies\nPinus strobus\nQuercus rubra\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "The given instructions are asking for a list of deciduous trees. Here's my response:\n\nDeciduous trees include: \nAcer rubrum (maple), Acer saccharinum (sorrel), Cornus florida (flowering dogwood), Picea glauca (white spruce), Pinus strobus (white pine), Quercus rubra (oak)\nYou are a helpful assistant.moid", "num_tokens": 87, "green_tokens": 42, "green_fraction": 0.4827586206896552, "z_score": -0.3216337604513384, "p_value": 0.6261349176879327, "dedup_num_tokens": 85, "dedup_green_tokens": 41, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.4823529411764706, "dedup_z_score": -0.32539568672798425, "dedup_p_value": 0.6275591902270219, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 224, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-00342", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nIf each client was served by the same number of professionals, how many professionals (round to one decimal place) would each client be served by?\n\n### Context:\nRGP, formerly known as Resources Global Professionals, is the operating arm of Resources Connection, Inc. (NASDAQ:RGP). The company provides consulting services in the areas of finance & accounting; information management; governance, risk & compliance (GRC); human capital; legal & regulatory; corporate advisory & restructuring; strategic communications; and supply chain management. As of fiscal year ending May 28, 2016, the company employed 3,283 professionals in 68 offices in 20 countries around the world. The company reported serving over 1,700 clients. Company headquarters are located in Irvine, CA.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "The company would serve each client by approximately 4.5 professionals.", "num_tokens": 14, "green_tokens": 9, "green_fraction": 0.6428571428571429, "z_score": 1.0690449676496976, "p_value": 0.14252470370130638, "dedup_num_tokens": 14, "dedup_green_tokens": 9, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.6428571428571429, "dedup_z_score": 1.0690449676496976, "dedup_p_value": 0.14252470370130638, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 225, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-00676", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhy there is no infant rice cereal in the market now?\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Infant rice cereal is a product that is often available in the market, especially for babies. However, there is no evidence that the infant rice cereal is a safe and healthy food for infants. It is possible that the product is labeled as such to keep the price of the cereal low, but it is important for parents to be aware of the potential health risks associated with consuming infant rice cereal.", "num_tokens": 79, "green_tokens": 43, "green_fraction": 0.5443037974683544, "z_score": 0.7875615306482168, "p_value": 0.21547661200039447, "dedup_num_tokens": 72, "dedup_green_tokens": 40, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5555555555555556, "dedup_z_score": 0.9428090415820635, "dedup_p_value": 0.17288929307558015, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 226, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
