{"id": "dolly-10839", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nGiven this paragraph about Pablo Escobar, how much money did he have when he died?\n\n### Context:\nPablo Emilio Escobar Gaviria (/ˈɛskəbɑːr/; Spanish: [ˈpaβlo es.koˈβ̞aɾ]; 1 December 1949 – 2 December 1993) was a Colombian drug lord and narcoterrorist who was the founder and sole leader of the Medellín Cartel. Dubbed \"the king of cocaine\", Escobar was the wealthiest criminal in history, having amassed an estimated net worth of US$30 billion by the time of his death—equivalent to $70 billion as of 2022—while his drug cartel monopolized the cocaine trade into the United States in the 1980s and early 1990s.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Pablo Escobar had a net worth of approximately $70 billion in 2022, equivalent to $70 billion as of 2022. This sum includes his estimated net worth of $30 billion from the drug cartel monopoly, which was primarily due to the cocaine trade in the United States.", "num_tokens": 66, "green_tokens": 36, "green_fraction": 0.5454545454545454, "z_score": 0.7385489458759964, "p_value": 0.23009046772356015, "dedup_num_tokens": 56, "dedup_green_tokens": 32, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5714285714285714, "dedup_z_score": 1.0690449676496976, "dedup_p_value": 0.14252470370130638, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 244, "