{"id": "dolly-14476", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhat is the greenhouse effect?\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "The greenhouse effect refers to the warming of the Earth's atmosphere and ocean due to the absorption and re-emission of infrared radiation by the Earth's surface. This process is caused by the greenhouse gases (such as carbon dioxide, methane, and water vapor) that trap heat from the sun and prevent it from escaping into space. This process is known as the greenhouse effect, and it is a major contributor to the warming of the planet and the resulting changes in climate.", "num_tokens": 93, "green_tokens": 60, "green_fraction": 0.6451612903225806, "z_score": 2.799769575772148, "p_value": 0.0025569548307403135, "dedup_num_tokens": 79, "dedup_green_tokens": 49, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.620253164556962, "dedup_z_score": 2.1376670117594454, "dedup_p_value": 0.016271889353406992, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 288, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
{"id": "dolly-04438", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhere is Malard\n\n### Context:\nMalard (Persian: ملارد, also Romanized as Malārd and Melārd; also known as Malār) is a city in the Central District of Malard County, Tehran province, Iran, and serves as capital of the county.\n\nAt the 2006 census, its population was 228,673 in 61,302 households. The following census in 2011 counted 290,817 people in 85,445 households. The latest census in 2016 showed a population of 281,027 people in 86,830 households.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Malard, or just Malard, is a city in the Central District of the Iranian province of Malard County. It is the capital of the county.", "num_tokens": 32, "green_tokens": 20, "green_fraction": 0.625, "z_score": 1.414213562373095, "p_value": 0.0786496035251426, "dedup_num_tokens": 29, "dedup_green_tokens": 17, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.5862068965517241, "dedup_z_score": 0.9284766908852594, "dedup_p_value": 0.1765801766579939, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_prompt_tokens": 2048, "seed": 289, "kgw_enabled_during_generation": false}}
