{"id": "dolly-03773", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWhich of these are both movies and books: Harry Potter, Lord of the Rings, Brave World, The Shawshank Redemption.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "Harry Potter is a fictional book series written by J. K. Rowling, a British novelist. It is a fantasy novel set in the fictional world of Hogwarts, a magical school for young wizards and witches.\n\nLord of the Rings is a fictional epic poem by J. R. R. Tolkien, a British author. It is a fantasy epic poem set in the fictional Middle Earth world, and it tells the story of the Ring, a magical ring that grants the ability to manipulate the elements, and the Ringbearer, a character who uses the ring for the first time in Middle Earth.\n\nBrave World is a novel by British author J. G. Ballard, a British author and philosopher. It is a dystopian novel set in the fictional future, and it tells the story of a group of characters who have a difficult time finding a peaceful place to live and work in the future.\n\nThe Shawshank Redemption is a novel by American author Frank Miller, a British author and filmmaker. It is a dystopian novel set in the fictional prison world of Shawshank State Penitentiary, and it tells the story of a man who escapes from the prison and finds peace with the outside world.\nfoy", "num_tokens": 241, "green_tokens": 158, "green_fraction": 0.6556016597510373, "z_score": 4.831174698006231, "p_value": 6.786492085583401e-07, "dedup_num_tokens": 169, "dedup_green_tokens": 105, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.621301775147929, "dedup_z_score": 3.1538461538461537, "d