{"id": "dolly-07355", "model_label": "kgw_trained_student", "label": "kgw", "is_watermarked": true, "model_path": "/shared/wwx/EasyGAD/checkpoints/te_old_st_Qwen2.5-0.5B_gamma0.5_delta3/warmup/global_step_1813/actor/huggingface", "prompt": [{"content": "You are a helpful assistant.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Below is an instruction that describes a task. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nWrite me a text to someone I work with asking them to cover my shift because I got sick. Use a polite tone.\n\n### Response:\n", "role": "user"}], "answer": "You're welcome! Let's start by discussing your situation and how it may impact the work. I'm sorry to hear about your illness. It must have been difficult for you to be out of the office, especially since you were a key part of the team that supported me during this challenging time. \n\nI understand how important it is to take care of your health and well-being. Let's talk about how I can help. We can set up a plan together to ensure we can continue working while you are taking care of yourself. We can also discuss any changes in our work schedule or responsibilities that may be needed to accommodate your needs.\n\nI'm sorry to hear about your illness. It must have been difficult for you to be out of the office, especially since you were a key part of the team that supported me during this challenging time.", "num_tokens": 169, "green_tokens": 104, "green_fraction": 0.6153846153846154, "z_score": 3.0, "p_value": 0.0013498980316300957, "dedup_num_tokens": 125, "dedup_green_tokens": 78, "dedup_green_fraction": 0.624, "dedup_z_score": 2.7727242920997393, "dedup_p_value": 0.0027794598135352797, "kgw": {"gamma": 0.5, "delta": 3.0, "hash_key": 15485863, "seeding": "simple_1 (hash_key * previous_token_id)", "detection_threshold_z": 4.0, "deduplication": "unique (previous_token_id, token_id) pairs"}, "generation": {"temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "max_new_tokens": 1536, "max_promp